Sidney Prescott

Sidney Prescott is a fictional character and the primary protagonist of the "Scream" franchise. The character was created by Kevin Williamson. She is played by Canadian actress Neve Campbell. She first appeared in "Scream" (1996) followed by six sequels: "Scream 2" (1997), "Scream 3" (2000)," Scream 4" (2011)," Scream" (2022)," Scream VI" (2023; mentioned only) &" Scream VII" (2024)"Reel Views 2: The Ultimate Guide to the Best 1,000 Modern Movies on DVD and Video" by James Berardinelli, Roger Ebert; Published by Justin, Charles & Co., 2005;
